  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Coastal Pacific Food Distributors obligated $213M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors received 9,093 awards, with an average award size of $23.4K. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors obligations are up 49.8% year over year. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors has had steady activity across recent fiscal years: FY21 obligations were $110M, FY22 obligations were $156M, FY23 obligations were $140M, FY24 obligations were $119M, FY25 obligations were $142M, and FY26 obligations are $213M. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors does most of its FY2026 to date work in the All Other Miscellaneous Food Manufacturing NAICS, with $186M in obligations, followed by Commercial Bakeries with $27M and Marine Cargo Handling with $58.6K. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors totals reported here are contract obligations; award-value totals in detailed tables may show total contract values instead. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors current-year totals are partial, representing fiscal year to date obligations rather than a full fiscal year.",
