      },
      {
        "heading": "What products and markets does Coastal Pacific Food Distributors serve for the government?",
        "body": "Coastal Pacific Food Distributors is concentrated in All Other Miscellaneous Food Manufacturing, which accounts for $186M in FY2026 to date obligations. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors also serves Commercial Bakeries with $27M in obligations and Marine Cargo Handling with $58.6K in obligations. Coastal Pacific Food Distributors obligations in these NAICS reflect the company’s primary federal markets this fiscal year to date."
      }
